        "text": "\u201cHelp!\u201d\nThe man page system is the electronic manual for Linux ( man is short for man ual),\ndesigned to provide users with a convenient reference to all the detailed command\ninformation. This information includes command-prompt options, file formats,\nand program function usage.\nThe syntax for opening a man page is man <command name> .\nDon\u2019t know the command you\u2019re looking for or need basic information about\nusing the man page system? Just type man man to get started. When you\u2019re finished\nreading the man page, press Q to exit.",
